# The Emissary San d'Oria (Bastok 2-3, mission.bastok.the_emissary_sandoria). A level 30 Warrior of Bastok in Northern
# San d'Oria with the mission current (a GM; a GM's Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1's first mission out). Rival zone-
# in, another mission's script: the login plays Seekers of Adventure's Rumors from the West onZoneIn, which returns
# 878. Status 0: Baraka plays 539 (the mission's arm for any status but 2); Helaku 541 and Shakir 538 are their own
# scripts' events. Status 2 (a GM): Baraka's HERE_WITH_BUSINESS (a message, no event), Shakir 556, Helaku 536 whose
# finish moves to status 3. Status 3: Helaku's HELAKU_DIALOG (a message), Baraka 539, Shakir 538 (own). Status 4:
# Helaku 542, Shakir 538. Status 5: Helaku 543, whose finish completes the mission, moves it to status 6 and begins
# The Emissary.
lists ChateauDoraguille/Halver/onTrigger ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/501 GhelsbaOutpost/Warchief_Vatgit/onMobDeath NorthernSanDoria/Baraka/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/Helaku/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/Shakir/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/536 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/543
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=36,-2,-2 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Bastok TheEmissarySandoria current
login
trigger Baraka
finish-if-event
trigger Helaku
finish-if-event
trigger Shakir
finish-if-event
missionstatus Bastok 2
trigger Baraka
finish-if-event
trigger Shakir
finish-if-event
trigger Helaku
finish
trigger Helaku
finish-if-event
trigger Baraka
finish-if-event
trigger Shakir
finish-if-event
missionstatus Bastok 4
trigger Helaku
finish-if-event
trigger Shakir
finish-if-event
missionstatus Bastok 5
trigger Helaku
finish
